<title>UK: Sullom Voe oil liftings fell last week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe oil liftings fell last week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brent Blend crude oil loadings from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal fell to 400,376 tonnes in the week to April 22 from 632,615 tonnes the previous week, Shetland Islands Marine Operations said.</p>
<p>A third of the liftings went to the U.S. with one shipment to Poland and the remainder staying in Britain.</p>
